From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tessera <development@tessera.local>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:23:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Backport Moonrise palette IO and unload optimisations

Based on Paper commits f759838, be3fe45, 2987325 and e863872 by Spottedleaf. Preserve per-consumer NBT isolation and use an explicit detached-chunk serializer instead of ambient thread-local copy flags. Clear palette references on exceptional exits.

